<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-RGC closes part of Thalanga mine.</title>
<headline>RTRS-RGC closes part of Thalanga mine.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mining house RGC Ltd said on Tuesday that it had closed the eastern section of its Thalanga base metals mine in Queensland following ground movement last Friday.</p>
</text>
